        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/subnautica-2-header-2.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/subnautica-2\">Subnautica 2</a> is off to a roaring start, and developer Unknown Worlds recently celebrated the fact that <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/subnautica-2-krafton-unknown-worlds-earnout\">4m players have now dipped their toes into the waters of the ocean planet Proteus</a>. That's a lot of early access feedback to comb through, but the studio says it's been doing just that and has now shared more details on the changes and major additions it's planning to implement next.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/subnautica-2-developer-video-next-updates\">Read more</a></p>",
